Package: basifoR
Type: Package
Title: Retrieval and Processing of the Spanish National Forest Inventory
Version: 0.6
Date: 2024-06-29
Author: Wilson Lara <wilarhen@gmail.com>, Cristobal Ordonez <a_cristo@pvs.uva.es>, Felipe Bravo <fbravo@pvs.uva.es>
Maintainer: Wilson Lara <wilarhen@gmail.com>
Description: Data sets of the Spanish National Forest Inventory are processed to compute tree metrics and statistics. Function metrics2Vol() controls most of the routines.
URL: https://www.miteco.gob.es/es/biodiversidad/temas/inventarios-nacionales/inventario-forestal-nacional.html
License: GPL-3
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: curl,foreign,Hmisc,httr,measurements,RODBC,rvest,stats,utils
SystemRequirements: accessdatabaseengine.exe (Windows with a a 32-bit R version); mdbtools (Linux)
